# PRD NUTRI-SHARE — Notifikasi & Gamification

---

## 9.1 Notifikasi Real-Time (SSE)

### 9.1.1 Arsitektur

```
┌──────────┐    EventSource     ┌──────────────────┐
│ Browser  │◄═══ SSE stream ═══►│  FastAPI Server   │
│ (React)  │                   │                   │
│          │    GET /subscribe  │  ┌─────────────┐  │
│          │   ?user_id=N      │  │ SSE Manager  │  │
│          │                   │  │ (asyncio)    │  │
│          │                   │  │ per user     │  │
│          │                   │  │ asyncio.Queue│  │
└──────────┘                   │  └─────────────┘  │
                               └──────────────────┘
```

### 9.1.2 Implementasi

**Server (backend/services/notifications.py):**

```python
class SSEManager:
    _clients: dict[int, set[asyncio.Queue[str]]]  # user_id → queues

    def subscribe(user_id) → asyncio.Queue:
        queue = asyncio.Queue()
        clients[user_id].add(queue)
        return queue

    def unsubscribe(user_id, queue):
        clients[user_id].discard(queue)
        if not clients[user_id]:
            del clients[user_id]

    async def notify_user(user_id, data):
        message = f"data: {json.dumps(data)}\n\n"
        for queue in clients.get(user_id, []):
            await queue.put(message)
```

**Endpoint (routers/notifications.py):**

```python
@router.get("/notifications/subscribe")
async def subscribe_sse(user_id):
    queue = sse_manager.subscribe(user_id)

    async def event_generator():
        yield "data: connected\n\n"
        while True:
            try:
                message = await asyncio.wait_for(queue.get(), timeout=30)
                yield message
            except asyncio.TimeoutError:
                yield ":ping\n\n"  # keepalive

    return StreamingResponse(event_generator(), media_type="text/event-stream")
```

### 9.1.3 Tipe Notifikasi

| Tipe | Trigger | Penerima | Pesan |
|------|---------|----------|-------|
| `donation_available` | Donasi baru dipublikasi | Semua penerima verified | "Donasi Tersedia! Donasi {food_name} sejumlah {n} porsi telah dipublikasikan. Segera cek dashboard Anda!" |
| `claim_approved` | Admin approve klaim | Penerima + Donor | "Klaim Disetujui! Donasi {food_name} telah disetujui. Cek status terbaru di dashboard." |
| `verification` | Admin verifikasi user | User | "Akun Anda telah diverifikasi oleh admin." |
| `system` | Klaim baru | Semua admin | "Klaim Baru! Donasi {food_name} diklaim oleh {institution}. Segera review." |

### 9.1.4 Frontend Subscription

```typescript
// Real-time via SSE
useEffect(() => {
    const es = new EventSource(`/api/notifications/subscribe?user_id=${user.id}`);
    es.onmessage = (e) => {
        if (e.data === "connected") return;
        const data = JSON.parse(e.data);
        setNotifications(prev => [data, ...prev]);
        toast.success(data.title);
    };
    return () => es.close();
}, [user.id]);

// Fallback polling 30 detik
useEffect(() => {
    const timer = setInterval(async () => {
        const notifs = await api.fetchJSON(`/api/notifications?user_id=${user.id}`);
        setNotifications(notifs);
    }, 30000);
    return () => clearInterval(timer);
}, [user.id]);
```

### 9.1.5 Format Data SSE

```
data: connected\n\n
data: {"id":1,"user_id":7,"title":"Donasi Tersedia!","message":"Donasi...","type":"donation_available","is_read":0,"related_donation_id":5,"created_at":"2026-07-07T..."}\n\n
:ping\n\n
```

---

## 9.2 Gamification

### 9.2.1 Badges Donor

File: `backend/services/gamification.py`

| Badge | Icon | Threshold | Deskripsi |
|-------|------|-----------|-----------|
| Donator Pemula | 🌱 | total_donations ≥ 1 | "Donasi pertama Anda!" |
| Donator Aktif | ⭐ | total_donations ≥ 5 | "5 donasi telah disalurkan" |
| Pahlawan Pangan | 🏆 | total_donations ≥ 10 | "10 donasi — dampak luar biasa!" |
| Legenda Donasi | 👑 | total_donations ≥ 20 | "20+ donasi, sungguh menginspirasi!" |
| Favorit Penerima | ❤️ | review_count ≥ 5 | "5+ ulasan positif dari penerima" |

### 9.2.2 Implementasi

```python
def calculate_badges(total_donations: int, review_count: int) -> list[dict]:
    badges = []
    if total_donations >= 1:
        badges.append({"name": "Donator Pemula", "icon": "🌱", "desc": "Donasi pertama Anda!"})
    if total_donations >= 5:
        badges.append({"name": "Donator Aktif", "icon": "⭐", "desc": "5 donasi telah disalurkan"})
    if total_donations >= 10:
        badges.append({"name": "Pahlawan Pangan", "icon": "🏆", "desc": "10 donasi — dampak luar biasa!"})
    if total_donations >= 20:
        badges.append({"name": "Legenda Donasi", "icon": "👑", "desc": "20+ donasi, sungguh menginspirasi!"})
    if review_count >= 5:
        badges.append({"name": "Favorit Penerima", "icon": "❤️", "desc": "5+ ulasan positif dari penerima"})
    return badges
```

### 9.2.3 Tampilan Badge

Di Donor Dashboard — baris horizontal:

```
[🌱 Donator Pemula] [⭐ Donator Aktif] [🏆 Pahlawan Pangan]
```

Setiap badge: `flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white border rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 shadow-sm text-sm`
Tooltip: `title={b.desc}`

### 9.2.4 Top Donors (Halaman Pahlawan)

**Data:** `GET /api/public/top-donors`

```sql
SELECT * FROM donor_profiles ORDER BY total_donations DESC LIMIT 3
```

**Enrichment:** Hitung average rating dari tabel reviews tiap donor.

**Response:**
```json
[
  {
    "id": 6,
    "business_name": "Donor NutriShare",
    "total_donations": 15,
    "type": "restoran",
    "logo_url": "",
    "rating": "4.5",
    "review_count": 8
  }
]
```

**Tampilan:** 3 cards dengan rank badge (#1 emas, #2 perak, #3 perunggu), logo bulat, jumlah donasi, rating bintang, filter filter by type.

